---
import source from '../../../content/scenes/first-move.amx?raw';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import Cards from '../components/Cards.astro';
import {url,github} from '../lib/content';
---
<Page><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A language for 2D animation</p><h1>Scenes in code.<br/><em>Stories in motion.</em></h1><p class="lead">Start with a shape. Give it a rule.<br/>See where it takes you.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href={url('showcase/one-rule-many-forms/')}>Watch a scene <span>→</span></a><a class="button" href={url('playground/')}>Try in browser <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="keyframe"><span class="shape square"></span><span class="shape circle"></span><span class="shape triangle"></span></div><span class="art-caption">a little structure. a little freedom.</span><button class="motion-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Pause motion</button></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Made of motion</p><h2>One language.<br/>Different kinds of stories.</h2></div><p>Rhythm, explanation, expression.<br/>Different ways to begin.</p></div><Cards/><p class="small muted">Actual frames from the AMX sources. Open a work to explore it.</p></section>
<section class="code-section section"><div><p class="eyebrow">From an idea to a frame</p><h2>A small change.<br/>A visible difference.</h2><p>Write a scene, give time a few instructions, and press Run. No hidden timeline to keep in sync.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('learn/make-something-move/')}>Make your first movement →</a></div><div class="code-sample"><div class="code-top"><span>first-move.amx</span><span>01 / Learn</span></div><pre><code>{source}</code></pre><a href={url('playground/?scene=first-move')}>Open the complete source →</a></div></section>
<section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">Keep going</p><h2>Your next scene starts here.</h2><div class="routes"><a href={url('playground/')}><span>01 / In your browser</span><h3>Try an idea.</h3><p>Edit, run and download AMX. WebGPU required for playback.</p><b>Open Playground →</b></a><a href={github+'/releases'}><span>02 / On your computer</span><h3>Make it yours.</h3><p>Get a native release for a fuller authoring and export workflow.</p><b>Browse releases →</b></a><a href={github+'/blob/main/docs/contributing.md'}><span>03 / From source</span><h3>Build with Nix.</h3><p>A pinned development environment for the engine, tools and website.</p><b>Development guide →</b></a></div></section></Page>
<script>const button=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.motion-toggle');button?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const paused=button.getAttribute('aria-pressed')!=='true';button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(paused));button.textContent=paused?'Resume motion':'Pause motion';document.querySelector('.hero-art')?.classList.toggle('paused',paused);});</script>
